    where it leads. A seed commit is the template's own bytes at a REGULAR FILE inside this
    checkout, and nothing else there could be. Nothing beyond this run's own template bytes was
    written into that checkout, and nothing was staged.
    Replace that component with a real directory, then re-run:
        openRepoTools wip init"
			fi
