			# SUBMODULE at `handoffs` is a gitlink in this repository and a
			# whole repository on disk: `-d` is true, `-L` is false, step 6a
			# sees a CLEAN worktree because a clean submodule reports nothing,
			# and every presence test below answers false because a gitlink
			# carries no `handoffs/README.md` for `:$rel` or `HEAD:$rel` to
